{"availability":"available","full":"owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal","name":"ftn-nastavni-portal","description":"Javni portal za nastavne materijale, prezentacije, primere i projektne informacije na FTN-u","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-24T20:01:04Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:57:53Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://ftn-nastavni-portal.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://owlcoder.github.io/ftn-nastavni-portal/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.624Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.624Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.624Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.624Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A browser-based desktop for course materials, exercises, and learning tools.","FTN Teaching Portal is an open-source React and TypeScript application that presents course material in a desktop-like interface inspired by GNOME Shell and Adwaita. It offers a file-manager workflow for navigating study materials without switching browser tabs, a custom PDF reader, an exercise viewer, and small built-in applications.","The educational content is primarily in Serbian. This is a web application, not an operating system or a GNOME distribution. The project is independent and is not an official product of the University of Novi Sad, GNOME, AMD, or NVIDIA."],"features":["Desktop workspace: movable, minimizable and maximizable application windows, launcher search, collision-free draggable desktop shortcuts, right-click and left-click context actions, keyboard-accessible menus, persistent…","Course file manager: nested exercise, presentation and example folders, expandable navigation tree, breadcrumbs and file previews for ERS, OIB, ODP and IBIS.","Continuous practicum reader: document-style scrolling, collapsible table of contents, links to exercises and zoom controls.","Custom PDF viewer: PDF.js-powered rendering with page navigation, zoom, fullscreen mode and downloads, rather than the browser's built-in PDF toolbar.","ZIP explorer and downloads: browse example archives, preview text-based source files, download individual documents or export entire folders as ZIP archives."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"640b9b116226fc5486502e020691a0ebdb6db0547243638279502d3f280cd4b8","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.753Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.753Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A browser-based desktop for course materials, exercises, and learning tools.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The desktop uses a local-only illustrative login:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Never use this login for private files, student records, or real access control.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"640b9b116226fc5486502e020691a0ebdb6db0547243638279502d3f280cd4b8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.754Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T05:57:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/owlCoder/ftn-nastavni-portal/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.755Z","hash":"640b9b116226fc5486502e020691a0ebdb6db0547243638279502d3f280cd4b8","originalBytes":18994,"storedBytes":18994,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["desktop","course","github","local","pages","pdf","application","browser","files","practicum","applications","deployment","export","file","open","run","actions","build","dock","project","settings","text","zip","examples","live","materials","npm","preview","see","sys